protonsync
==========

This project builds on, and distributes a patched build of, the following
MIT-licensed open-source projects. Their copyright and license terms continue
to apply to the corresponding code.

1. rclone
   https://github.com/rclone/rclone
   Copyright (C) The rclone Authors
   Licensed under the MIT License.

2. Proton-API-Bridge
   https://github.com/rclone/Proton-API-Bridge
   Licensed under the MIT License.

3. go-proton-api
   https://github.com/rclone/go-proton-api
   Licensed under the MIT License.

The patches under rclone-build/patches/ are modifications to the projects above
and are released under the MIT License (see LICENSE). The prebuilt
`protonsync-rclone` binary distributed via GitHub Releases is a compiled
derivative work of the three projects above and is likewise covered by their
MIT licenses.

protonsync is an unofficial, community integration. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by Proton AG or the rclone project. "Proton" and
"Proton Drive" are trademarks of their respective owners and are used here only
to describe interoperability.
